      "text": "Rio de Janeiro has green hills, blue sky, beautiful bays, islands and marvellous beaches: Brazil’s second-largest city after São Paulo and one of the most beautiful in the world. Copacabana, Ipanema and Leblon are famous for their black-and-white mosaic promenades, and Rio offers almost any sport, from golf, tennis and surfing to diving and hang-gliding. The journey then continues to the Iguazu Falls, to discover their thundering power from both the Brazilian and Argentine sides.",
